Correct: your code uses the exact conversion formulas for Kelvin and Fahrenheit with optimal constant time and constant auxiliary memory.

REVIEW MY CODE

What I did well:

You initialized the vector with the exact required size of 2, avoiding runtime reallocations.

You used the exact floating-point constants specified by the problem (273.15, 1.80, 32.00).

You directly placed Kelvin at index 0 and Fahrenheit at index 1, matching the required output format.

